note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
note apps/omega-metabd/general_pe.om: Stage 4 (Pillar 1) General Multi-Block ΩIR Partial Evaluator,
note EGP3 Proof Pipeline, Native AArch64 Machine-Code Emitter, Strict W^X (RW->SHA256->RX) Sealer,
note 3-Bit Proof Gate (Contract|EGP3|Monk+Immune == 7), Cooperative fabWtbl Hot-Swap & OOD Rollback.
note
note Pure seeded OM-2 library unit (no om2 header, no fn main).
note Prefixes: gpe_/GPE_ (partial evaluator + ΩIR eval + AArch64 emit), wx_/WX_ (strict W^X), mb_/MB_ (daemon core).
note Links unchanged after: ir.om, sha256.om, target_desc.om, isel.om, sm121_pe.om, fabric.om,
note crystallize.om, ir_egraph.om, egp3_checker.om, arboris_spec.om, profile_ring.om.

